* ZDENST - CONFIGURE THE ZDE EDITOR

SYSOP ONLY. Private utility; use the local sysop console.

A - Purpose, syntax and examples

:A
* ZDENST - CONFIGURE THE ZDE EDITOR

SYSOP ONLY. Private utility; use the local sysop console.

Syntax:
    SYSUTLS:ZDENST

Interactive installer for the supplied ZDE editor. Selects
terminal/control-key configuration and writes the configured executable.
It is a maintenance utility, not an editor invocation.

Back up I13:ZDE.COM before saving changes. Keep the ANSI/VT100 setup used
by this installation and verify ZDE on a scratch text file afterward.

See HELP COMMANDS for the command index.
